<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates a published or digital manifestation to the expression it embodies. The original property has domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R4 embodies"@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R4 incarna"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega una manifestazione editoriale o digitale all'espressione che incorpora. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4i_is_embodied_in> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
